<title>JAPAN: Kentucky Fried Japan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kentucky Fried Japan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 38.78		vs	   38.89</p>
<p> Operating	    1.72		vs	    2.49</p>
<p> Current		1.90		vs	    2.68</p>
<p> Net		  965    million	  vs	    1.35</p>
