<p> Shares	     23 million	  vs	  23 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 10.00 yen	  vs	   10.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kentucky Fried Chicken Japan Ltd is a major fried chicken restaurant operator.</p>
